    "created_at": "2017-07-25T19:34:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-07-25T19:36:41Z",
    "body": "Ahah!  Your (annevk) interpretation of the spec is exactly why i think we should remove any mention of \"CSS pixels\" in the CRC2D spec. It's too confusing. The way I interpret the spec is that the canvas context has its own local coordinate system in \"CSS pixels\" which does not correspond to the canvas element's layout coordinate system (i.e. the coordinate system of the parent stacking context).\r\n\r\nFWIW, I arrived at this interpretation by reverse engineering the spec text based on prior knowledge of how canvas works. That's not good.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
