    "created_at": "2017-07-26T08:42:25Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-07-26T08:42:25Z",
    "body": "Justin, I think I see what you mean now. I looked into rewording things and one reason that's hard is all the references to CSS boxes for text rendering. And I guess there's indeed this double thing going on where there's two coordinate systems both defined in CSS pixels but they're not necessarily 1:1.",
